    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Colours"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Counting down and counting up each get their own colour, both green to start. Set them apart and a timer running past zero changes colour as it becomes a stopwatch. The middle and the interval band are shaded from your choice, so only colours that stay legible when shaded are offered."
      },
      {
